    {
      "heading": "Obfuscated Fields",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Select tunnel fields support obfuscation, as indicated by the prefix o. For example, the field %s{olocationname} is the obfuscated version of %s{locationname}. Instead of displaying the location name, the obfuscated field displays a random string in the NSS feed output."
    },
